OL,3,GNEWSA'It's party time' as Tour of
OL,4,ABritain reaches Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpectators, cycling groups and a former
OL,7,FOlympian were among those who welcomed
OL,8,Friders to Hull and East Yorkshire for
OL,9,Fstage three of the 2026 Tour of Britain
OL,10,Fmen's cycling race earlier.
OL,12,FThe riders set off in Hull and raced
OL,13,Fthrough towns and villages including
OL,14,FBilton, Preston, Hedon, Withernsea,
OL,15,FMappleton, Hornsea, Skipsea, Langtoft
OL,16,Fand Driffield, before finishing in
OL,17,FBeverley.
OL,19,FThey covered a total of about 120.6
OL,20,Fmiles (194.1km), with an elevation of
OL,21,F636.8ft (1,612m).
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
